108	+
109	+  // "Opening a second item closes the first" (AC: one expanded at a time) is covered by
110	+  // index.stories.tsx's OnlyOneExpandedAtATime play function, not duplicated here — see
111	+  // testing.md's "do not duplicate coverage across layers" rule. That story is the cheaper
112	+  // layer for this specific assertion since it's a user-facing click interaction.
113	+
114	+  // Guards against a regression of the `findIndex === -1` fallback: Chakra logs and misbehaves
